    "body": "I obtained this file through ESV, and it is taking a long time to process the LRS which indicates that there is probably a very large repeated substring. Again @joshuaehill is right, the length of the LRS does drastically increase the runtime... Starting with the base case, LRS = 2, we need to check all of them if they are still equal if LRS = 3, ... repeat that for a very large LRS and it's an O(n^2) problem. ",
